{
  "slug": "laravel-best-practices",
  "name": "Laravel Best Practices",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This package publishes an AI agent skill covering Laravel best practices — including Inertia + React conventions — into multiple locations to support various AI agents and editors",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `laravel-best-practices` (Enforce Laravel best practices for code generation and review — SRP, skinny controllers, FormRequests, Policies, service/action classes, Eloquent,…), `laravel-update-with-rector` (Upgrades a Laravel application or package to a newer Laravel version using Rector and driftingly/rector-laravel), `php-update-with-rector` (Upgrades a PHP project to a newer PHP version using Rector — the automated refactoring tool)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install laravel-best-practices@claude-community` from `masterfermin02/laravel-agent-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
